+   - Compute dot product $d = \mathbf{n} \cdot \mathbf{d}$.
+   - If $d \neq 0$, compute $s = \frac{\mathbf{n} \cdot (P_0 - \mathbf{o})}{d}$.
+   - Compute intersection point $P = \mathbf{o} + s\mathbf{d}$.
